# This app reads no secrets. It calls no API and makes no network request.
#
# The file is kept because the scaffold it came from used it, and because a
# client build will need one: a generation provider, the platform credentials
# for publishing, and whatever backs analytics. None of that exists here.
#
# The only variable the project actually reads is DISABLE_HMR, used by the dev
# server; see vite.config.ts.
